{"sections":[{"slug":"范畴O","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"范畴O"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“范畴 O”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">几何表示论</span></p>\n<p>BGG <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> Bernstein–Gelfand–Gelfand <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">固定</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Cartan子代数","text":"Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Borel子代数","text":"Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak b$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">是由如下</span> $\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">组成的范畴</span>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>$M$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有限生成</span>;</li>\n<li>$M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/权模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">权模</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathfrak n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的作用局部有限</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即对任意</span> $v\\in M$, $(U\\mathfrak n) v$ <span lang=\"zh\">是有限维的</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Verma模","text":"Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">所有有限维表示属于范畴</span> $\\mathcal O$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">反例</span></h3>\n<p>$U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为自身的左模不属于范畴</span> $\\mathcal O$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">伴随表示不属于</span> $\\mathcal O$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">对子模封闭</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">任何</span> $M\\in\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Noether <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">的每个对象都是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Verma模","text":"Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的有限次接续扩张的商</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">分裂为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/块","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">块</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O)"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的直和</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">投射对象</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">有足够多</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/投射对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">投射对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}